+- **Mutant** (the walk does not descend into folders): 3 failed | 2 passed (VP-1, VP-2, VP-4). Reverted.
+- Neighbours, one file per run: `sync/index.test.ts` 4 passed, `greeting-size.test.ts` 11 passed. `tsc --noEmit` exit 0.
